Cloud Build API — What is it?

Cloud Build API is a Google Cloud service that lets you automatically build, test, and deploy your application.

====

For your project, the flow can be:

Your Code
   ↓
GitHub
   ↓
Cloud Build API
   ↓
Build Docker Container
   ↓
Store Image
   ↓
Deploy to Cloud Run 🚀

======

What Cloud Build does

| Step | Cloud Build Action                |
| ---- | --------------------------------- |
| 1    | Gets your source code             |
| 2    | Installs dependencies             |
| 3    | Runs tests                        |
| 4    | Builds Docker image               |
| 5    | Pushes image to Artifact Registry |
| 6    | Can deploy to Cloud Run           |


